Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's tame the octopus\Nand make him pull our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a good look! No, you don't have\Nto take a good look since it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must've been around\Nfor several hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The kraken appears\Nin many myths in the world -
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's like a visionary creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has no bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm a skeleton without any flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the polar opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't see this kind of thing often, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sketching? How relaxed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help you but do you have any plan, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem is that we're in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem is the size of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be dangerous\Neven if we were on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:04.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of situation when everybody\Nagrees to run away at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shift the helm to the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, go straight towards the octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.14,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!{crunchyroll didnt subtitle usopp but it sounds like hes saying "だから"}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The octopus will...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.94,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, Nami{-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,here for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You held it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the rehabilitation\Nand to Nami for wearing a coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be on this ship!\NI've got to protect myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coribou! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna save my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You came back to save me, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:03.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The coating popped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ship is even bigger than {\i1}Sunny{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They look like a school of jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Roronoa! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can we fight against it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Gear Thir–
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll break the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,175)}Chicken Voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we... get away somehow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything! I'll beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! You're gonna break the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:05:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen! If you wanna fight\Nagainst it that much, here is an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the extra-vehicular flutter kick coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An extra-vehicular diving suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as you're in it, you can fight\Nas you want even in water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I let these fools do whatever\Nthey want, I'll be in danger too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done that, stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We wanted to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, they're gonna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you guys to run from the beginning\Nbut that Captain{-san} won't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you rather they fought on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This rope is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to attach the safety rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}'s worrying about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Draw his attention for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat him with one strong blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could beat him right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want the octopus as a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay as far away as you can!\NEven a millimeter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move aside, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It deflected the tentacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, another arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does it keep coming after us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got a hard hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit a sea mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What big hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our Robin! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although I'm in water, I was okay\Nbecause it was just a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gear Third!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Armament: Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea is sapping my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That damn octopus! Is it trying to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Sanji{-san} left his bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind that! Look at that speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's like a fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I ran and ran...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,from those abominations for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:38.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Compared to them, the monster is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It actually looks rather cute to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Grill Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three-Sword Style Secret Technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Crossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey hey, Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't cut his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He knocked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gotten so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Something is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that shark wearing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fairly big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've been swept away\Nby the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Follow them!\NWe have to stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My eyes are spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't have eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the yard level!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash into the continental shelf!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your concentration,\Nor the ship will wreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get thrown off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay in the center of the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Why are you all so glum?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh I know! You guys can't\Ndo anything without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so cold here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't find Luffy and the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope they haven't been shredded\Nto pieces by the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your imagination is terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too dark - I wanna look\Nfor them but I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I feel something, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We probably submerged around 7,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the Shark Submerge\Ncan't take the pressure this deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we near Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they got there already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camie{-chan} said it's located\Nat 10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to submerge 3,000 meters more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All they have is a small bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if they're alive,\Nthere isn't enough air so it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I told them\Nto attach the safety rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't accomplish anything\Nstanding around like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I now have a search light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.01,0:12:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it your eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Nipple Lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In this vast, submerged expanse,\Nthe Sunny Eyes don't help that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The darkness is stirring up our anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.06,0:13:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't stop the ship\Nso try not to overlook anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a massive jellyfish above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're twinkling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like stars in the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, a tentacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Do you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably venomous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A little... Coup de Burst! - OG}{\fad(150,150)}Mini Coup de Burst!{Viz, turned into move name for better timing here and later}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wh-What?!\N– Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The jellyfish got eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, we lost some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better than getting eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?!\N– Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de Burst is a weapon\Nthat shoots a fair amount of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But since we're in the water,\Nwe only have a limited amount of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So when we shoot the air out,\Nthe bubble shrinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fish that got bitten turned upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they contain a neurotoxin as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deep sea's scary! It's dark too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of fish with white eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's creepy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since the deep sea is always dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are many creatures\Nwith rudimentary eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they can't see well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See this? Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there are some with developed eyes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that? How can I\Nsee things without eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you people wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm used to being lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop fooling around and look for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did I get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!\N– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:54.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Where are you?!\N– Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This rope must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you seen that pirate guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he's still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him since we got this deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he got thrown off\Nduring the downward pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That could be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His hands and legs were tied up\Nso he couldn't hold on to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He untied himself. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Then, he's somewhere on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got to be hiding somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:48.16,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll sneak into the girls' room–\Nif that's what you want, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have enough problems already\Nbut now we have to look out for him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not that strong anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:09.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Those formidable three who were fighting\Nagainst the kraken went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:14.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could have\Nsurvived after getting lost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,with just those bubbles to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:21.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that I couldn't kill Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:31.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,but I can prove that he's dead by killing\Nthese crewmembers and taking their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:36.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But don't rush, Caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.57,0:17:38.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:42.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I kill them here, there's\Nno one else to sail the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They navigate the ship pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:49.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get to Fishman Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:53.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,you all will be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:17:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:08.17,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Shoot! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now he can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How did he get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We weren't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he wasn't so stupid,\Nwe could be in danger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His body wasn't taking form.\NIt has melted like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure it's a devil fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must've eaten a logia-type fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was only pretending to be caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here, mister!\NMister in swimshorts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll become your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel hot all of the sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's blocking our view forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:19:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke from the sea floor? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hydrothermal deposits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A volcanic area in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, you can see that\Nthere were volcanic eruptions here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it erupts, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hot... It's hot...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carnivorous tubeworms!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A little... Coup de Burst! - OG}{\fad(150,150)}Mini Coup de Burst!{Viz, turned into move name for better timing}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faceless crabs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A little... Coup de Burst! - OG}{\fad(150,150)}Mini Coup de Burst!{Viz, turned into move name for better timing}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A little... Coup de Burst! - OG}{\fad(150,150)}Mini Coup de Burst!{Viz, turned into move name for better timing}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deep sea's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:20:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others can't survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally got to see him after two years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! They're not gonna die so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I used Coup de Burst little by little\Nbut we lost so much air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.47,0:20:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think Luffy and the others are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We haven't submerged\Nanother 3,000 meters yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"WHO-ARE-YOU?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you sending\Nthe flashing signals with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's still too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an angler! He tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were fooled by the deep-sea hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're totally trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we get away...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Is it a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A monster in the sea that looks like a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a sea bonze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna capsize the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ankoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't eat ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Vander Decken{-sama} won't like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Did he help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go! We have to get away anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is a monster too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Dead men tell no tales, they have no desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}In the dark land where even crows can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Dead men don't need jewels on their finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}You can't even see somebody's sorrow in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Look for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Look for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Sunken treasures are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}I am the richest person in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.05,0:22:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even in the sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:22:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ghost ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I turned! For no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We thought that you were\Na ghost at that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That is the real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The infamous Flying Dutchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.51,0:23:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't exist in the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It happened several hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One stormy day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the captain of the pirate ship\Nsuddenly lost his mind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and killed all his crew by throwing them\Ninto troubled waters one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he even cursed the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The name of the captain was Vander Decken...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the ship was the Flying Dutchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gods got mad at him...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and set him adrift forever\Nunder constant torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the ship right in front of us\Nis Captain Vander Decken's haunted ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't seize their treasure\Nif you eat the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.53,0:24:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so knock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.73,0:24:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea bonze is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.57,0:24:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't! The fuel has run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.61,0:24:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to fill up with cola in the energy room!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.42,0:24:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.75,0:24:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Monster of the Arctic--Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.22,0:25:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.07,0:25:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.97,0:25:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're all alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.61,0:25:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.51,0:25:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san} my sweet! Robin{-chan} my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.35,0:25:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.79,0:25:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so high-maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.63,0:25:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Avenge yourself! Get back at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, Sanji's bubble and mine\Npopped so we got into Zoro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.91,0:25:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.41,0:25:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make us worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.44,0:26:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, here's a song to celebrate your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.11,0:26:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lots of space! There's no place like home!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:08.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all have an amazing ability to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really tamed the monster octopus?
Comment: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really tamed the monster octopus?
Comment: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really tamed the monster octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And are you gonna use the kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.93,0:26:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm gonna use him\Nlike experienced people do!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a squid snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.41,0:26:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kraken is an octopus\Nbut he named it Surume, oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, draw the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, instead of making him draw the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.05,0:26:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure\Nthat he's not gonna smash it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.09,0:26:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, the pirate ship is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.36,0:26:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away! Go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.01,0:27:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no good, Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.22,0:27:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.22,0:27:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The undersea volcano's gonna erupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
